terminal, and the Port Jefferson Ferry, making daily commutes effortless."}, {"tag": "p", "box": {"x": 765, "y": 1054, "width": 600, "height": 132}, "styles": {"backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)", "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)", "fontFamily": "stevie-sans, proxima-nova, \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif", "fontSize": "16px", "fontWeight": "400", "lineHeight": "22px", "letterSpacing": "normal", "borderTopColor": "rgb(255, 255, 255)", "borderTopWidth": "0px", "borderRadius": "0px", "boxShadow": "none", "paddingTop": "0px", "paddingLeft": "0px", "marginTop": "16px", "gap": "normal", "display": "block", "textAlign": "start", "position": "static"}, "children": [], "text": "While the units were recently renovated for market-rate rents, in partnership with the Department of Housing, they are now being converted into affordable housing. Upon arrival, you will be welcomed by a beautifully designed lobby. Each apartment features an open-concept living room connected to an eat-in kitchen, complete with granite countertops and top-of-the-line stainless-steel appliances. Additionally, all units are equipped with central air conditioning."}, {"tag": "p", "box": {"x": 765, "y": 1202, "width": 600, "height": 132}, "styles": {"backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)", "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)", "fontFamily": "stevie-sans, proxima-nova, \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif", "fontSize": "16px", "fontWeight": "400", "lineHeight": "22px", "letterSpacing": "normal", "borderTopColor": "rgb(255, 255, 255)", "borderTopWidth": "0px", "borderRadius": "0px", "boxShadow": "none", "paddingTop": "0px", "paddingLeft": "0px", "marginTop": "16px", "gap": "normal", "display": "block", "textAlign": "start", "position": "static"}, "children": [{"tag": "a", "box": {"x": 1118, "y": 1247, "width": 163, "height": 19}, "styles": {"backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)", "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)", "fontFamily": "stevie-sans, proxima-nova, \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif", "fontSize": "16px", "fontWeight": "700", "lineHeight": "22px", "letterSpacing": "normal", "borderTopColor": "rgb(255, 255, 255)", "borderTopWidth": "0px", "borderRadius": "0px", "boxShadow": "none", "paddingTop": "0px", "paddingLeft": "0px", "marginTop": "0px", "gap": "normal", "display": "inline", "textAlign": "start", "position": "static"}, "children": [], "text": "Community amenities", "href": "https://www.parkcityplace.org/apartments/ct/bridgeport/amenities"}], "text": "These apartments will be available in Downtown Bridgeport for households earning at or below 80% of the Area Median Income. The breakdown includes 51 one-bedroom units and 46 two-bedroom units. include a combined laundry and lounge area, a fitness center, and controlled access. Park City Place offers a convenient lifestyle for those seeking the best of urban living in Bridgeport. A parking garage is also available for residents at a monthly charge.", "textRuns": ["These apartments will be available in Downtown Bridgeport for households earning at or below 80% of the Area Median Income. The breakdown includes 51 one-bedroom units and 46 two-bedroom units.", "include a combined laundry and lounge area, a fitness center, and controlled access. Park City Place offers a convenient lifestyle for those seeking the best of urban living in Bridgeport. A parking garage is also available for residents at a monthly charge."]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}], "background": {"url": "https://g5-assets-cld-res.cloudinary.com/image/upload/q_auto,f_auto,c_fill,g_center,h_960,w_1600/v1773910860/g5/g5-c-6ab10zxdi-mutual-housing-association-of-southwestern-connecticut-inc/g5-cl-1qv2b33m0t-mutual-housing-association-of-southwestern-connecticut-inc-bridgeport-ct/uploads/Denver_Background_Tertiary_bnx4vk.png", "size": "cover", "position": "50% 50%", "repeat": "no-repeat"}}]}]}]}